# Note: Cloudflare Pages auto-adds redirects for /page -> /page/ when
# the directory structure has /page/index.html. The rules below are
# a no-op for already-canonical paths.

# Home page: serve as-is, no redirect needed.
# Other pages: Pages handles /page -> /page/ automatically via
# pretty URLs. The 308 is expected behaviour.

